 "_doc": "WeFax Auto Plan (tools/wefax_plan/plan_to_c.py builds it into the firmware; a copy in /mnt/wefax/plan.json replaces it). slots: one a chart, its start in UTC (t), the station (st), its frequency in Hz (hz; the dial goes 1500 Hz below, USB), the chart (prod: copies of one chart within 16 h are the same chart, only the best is kept; a chart named unknown keeps every copy), the longest it lasts in s (dur), and fill: a filler that gives way to a slot of the plan. From a 48 h watch of 14-15 Nov 2026 in western Europe (F4OLI), the charts named from their titles as received 15-18 Nov. bulletin: the kinds of chart the Bulletin shows, each the charts starting with one of its match strings.",
